      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "DashboardSnapshot (sealed record)\n─────────────────────────────────────\n+ Data: DashboardData\n+ CapturedAt: DateTimeOffset\n+ IsStale(maxAge): bool\n\nvolatile _snapshot: DashboardSnapshot?\n  ← lock-free reads\n  ← atomic reference swap on write\n\nSemaphoreSlim(1,1) _refreshLock\n  ← WaitAsync(0) = non-blocking tryacquire\n  ← prevents cache stampedes",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.435897435897436
    },
